{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArpeggiate"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArpeggiate\/id"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specifies an id reference.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"id","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLArpeggiateV2idSSSgvp","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlarpeggiate\/id"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLArpeggiate":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArpeggiate","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLArpeggiate"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLArpeggiate"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlarpeggiate","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The arpeggiate type indicates that this note is part of an arpeggiated chord. The number attribute can be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to distinguish between two simultaneous chords arpeggiated separately (different numbers) or together (same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"number). The direction attribute is used if there is an arrow on the arpeggio sign. By default, arpeggios go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the lowest to highest note. The length of the sign can be determined from the position attributes for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arpeggiate elements used with the top and bottom notes of the arpeggiated chord. If the unbroken attribute is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set to yes, it indicates that the arpeggio continues onto another staff within the part. This serves as a hint"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to applications and is not required for cross-staff arpeggios."}],"title":"MXLArpeggiate"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLArpeggiate/id":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlarpeggiate\/id","title":"id","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specifies an id reference.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArpeggiate\/id"}}}